#   - A $1 rise in income is associated with about a 45% rise in rent.
#   - A $1 rise in income is associated with a $0.45 rise in rent.
#   ANSWER: A 1% rise in income is associated with about a 0.45% rise in rent.   (log-log = elasticity)

# [Quiz 9 #1] A regression gives saleshat = 50 + 20 log(advertising). What does the 20 mean?
#   - A $1 rise in advertising is associated with a rise of 20 units in predicted sales.
